  "description": "<p><strong>Brand Introduction:</strong><br>Kali Shoes&reg; is a distinctive brand specializing in handcrafted Texan boots made in Italy. Our identity is rooted in Italian craftsmanship, seamlessly combining tradition and innovation to create unique, colorful products that reflect personality and style. Every pair is a work of art, designed to stand out while embodying the excellence of Made in Italy.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Product Description:</strong><br>We offer a diverse selection of handcrafted Texan boots that go beyond style&mdash;they are also designed for comfort and everyday wear. Each pair represents our unwavering commitment to quality, sustainability, and ethical work practices, making them the perfect choice for those who value both fashion and conscience.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Unique Selling Point (USP):</strong><br>Our boots are crafted using upcycled leather sourced from certified tanneries, ensuring the highest attention to detail while minimizing waste. We proudly stand against fast fashion by focusing on made-to-order production, eco-friendly materials, and low-impact production processes. With Kali Shoes, you&rsquo;re not just promoting a product&mdash;you&rsquo;re advocating for a sustainable, thoughtful approach to fashion.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><br>Affiliates will receive payments via PayPal, Bank Transfer, or Store Credits, allowing flexibility in choosing the most convenient option.</p>",
